      "kind": "grammar",
      "title": "मुझे अच्छा लगता है",
      "text": "\"I like it\" is also said मुझे अच्छा लगता है — \"to me it seems good\". Like पसंद है, the person gets मुझे or को. Use it for a place, a person or a situation you like to be in.",
      "explains": [
        "hi.laga"
      ],
      "afterScenes": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "n2",
      "kind": "grammar",
      "title": "रहता है, करती है",
      "text": "For one other person the helper is है: रवि काम करता है, मीरा काम करती है. For \"I\" it is हूँ and for \"we\" or आप it is हैं. The -ता / -ती part follows the person who does it.",
      "explains": [
        "hi.third-person-habitual"
      ],
      "afterScenes": 1
    }
  ],
